  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Mom is at school. Lily and Tom are with her. Tom is Lily's brother. \"Goodbye, Mom!\" says Lily. \"Goodbye, Lily!\" says Mom. \"Goodbye, Tom!\"",
      "Lily is in a line. Mia is next to her. Leo is behind her. Leo is a classmate. \"Hello, Leo!\" says Lily. Leo hits her with his bag. \"Sorry!\" says Leo. \"Don't worry,\" says Lily.",
      "\"Hello, children!\" says Teacher Kim. \"Hello, Teacher Kim!\" \"Please sit here, Lily,\" says Teacher Kim. Lily sits between Mia and Leo. \"Thank you, Teacher Kim!\" Mia smiles. Is it a good day? Yes!"
    ],
